    ],
    "autonima": "included_fulltext",
    "reason": "Alcohol-dependent inpatients (n=130) vs controls (n=69), MRI. I1 met only loosely: total and hemispheric GM volumes (normalized to ICV) are compared globally. I2 not met: the only whole-brain spatial contrast is a surface-based, node-to-node cortical thickness analysis (FreeSurfer/SUMA). There is no whole-brain voxelwise contrast of GM volume, density or concentration. E1 not met, because the analysis was not ROI-only. E2 not met, because the study is empirical."
   },
   {
    "pmid": "23190458",
    "decision": "exclude",
    "failed": [
